  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday through next Thursday)\nIssued at 1101 PM CDT Thu Aug 27 2026\n\nLong range models still display some disagreement on the placement \nof the upper high late in the long term. Whichever scenario pans \nout, the high shows no signs of becoming suppressed as we head \ninto September. Therefore, hot +100 degree highs will prevail \nthrough the next 7 days. PoPs remain present at the forefront of \nthe extended period due to favorable anticyclonic steering flow. \nHowever, PoPs continue to trend downward and our northwest zones \nmay be the only locations favored to receive precipitation next \nweek. \n\nRangel",
